# mlplant React UI

This frontend is generated by `mlplant build --ui`.

## Run

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## API Base URL

By default this app targets:

- `{{ api_base }}`

To override, create `.env`:

```bash
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
```

The form schema is loaded dynamically from `/openapi.json` (`InputData`).
